This directory contains OpenWAM's first-class Wan backbone code, extracted from the
previous vendored DiffSynth-based implementation.

Source attribution:
- Derived from DiffSynth-Studio (Apache 2.0)
- Original Wan-related implementation previously lived in OpenWAM's vendored
  video-backbone package.
- `camera_controller.py` includes camera-pose and ray-conditioning utilities
  adapted from CameraCtrl (<https://github.com/hehao13/CameraCtrl>), upstream
  revision UNKNOWN, under the Apache License 2.0. The file was modified for
  integration with OpenWAM's Wan backbone and adapter interface.

OpenWAM keeps the original Apache 2.0 license in `license/LICENSE`; the
repository-level LICENSE is the same Apache 2.0 text.
